    "Baseline published0.1.47 commit552d8f7, active Spawn/Parkour. Survival remains0.1.45 by explicit owner request to deliver only. Source change0.1.48 is not yet activation or measured uptime.",
    "arccivs.chunkload defaults false. Only fresh effective owner permission in server and settlement-world context admits background activity; members and viewers do not confer it. Offline-owner LuckPerms lookup is read-only, no player grant or new purchase is included. Unknown or expired permission denies, positive lease refresh15s/TTL30s. Whole-settlement existing-chunk tickets are bounded globally, no new terrain or restart catch-up.",
    "Before viewer-dependent active workhours per ownerday0.25/1/4; after permitted continuously loaded ownerday1/6/13. These are low/base/high sensitivity assumptions, not measured worktime, guaranteed availability, enforced output caps or new work speed. Participants1/10/16 each with one exhausted mine and equippedminer. Multiple admitted settlements must fit per-runtime chunk and48NPC budgets.",
    "At normal Minecraft time, allowed daytime13000of24000ticks bounds ideal work opportunity to13hours per24realhours at20TPS. Night, hunger, toolbreakage, native terrain, protection, travel, bag/warehouse space and receipts reduce output. Native crop growth and mob spawning may require actualplayer proximity independently of plugin chunk tickets; no synthetic crop growth is introduced.",
    "Generator probability and base duration stay95percentCOBBLESTONE/4percentCOAL/1percentRAW_IRON and1item/6active seconds, ideal600events/hour. Incompatible pickaxes replaceore withcobble. NoFortune/Silk multiplier; nativewear and ordinaryinputs remain. Finite mining still2seconds/action withnative drops andfinite terrain, not an additional simultaneous generator stream.",
    "Before events perownerday150/600/2400 andafter600/3600/7800. Currency units item_cobblestone,item_coal,item_raw_iron remain separate; never summed withVault,tokens,playerXP. Three miners is a separate3xstress alternative, not proven worker availability. Generator is not observed live; currentrealminerwaitstool.",
    "Stable surplus rendezvous preservesacceptedpartialbatch whilefreshripecropappears. It transfers existing producerbag items torealcourierbag andwarehouse withsame onceonly receipts andreserves. Noextra itemmint, duration reduction, seed/tool/food grant or permission change. Night,combat,food,assignment/cyclechange and90secondexpiry stillrelease.",
    "DirectVault,tokens,playerXP netdelta0 separately. No prices or redeemableconversion added; no paidpermissioncatalog introduced. CurrentSELL remainscurrent, plannedSELLoff/contracttransition remainsfuture. Unknownrealizedexternalconversion is notzeroincome and isnotguessed here. Anyfuture sale is oneexternalconversion, notsecondminereward.",
